WEBVTT

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.695
He found himself.

00:09:30.719 --> 00:09:33.434
And I thought, "Anything
that works for a 15-year-old boy

00:09:33.458 --> 00:09:34.773
ought to work for me."

00:09:34.797 --> 00:09:38.383
So I got in my car,
and I drove three hours north

00:09:38.407 --> 00:09:39.859
along the coast,

00:09:39.883 --> 00:09:42.419
and the roads grew emptier and narrower,

00:09:42.443 --> 00:09:45.183
and then I turned
onto an even narrower path,

00:09:45.207 --> 00:09:48.823
barely paved, that snaked for two miles

00:09:48.847 --> 00:09:51.346
up to the top of a mountain.

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.185
And when I got out of my car,

00:09:54.209 --> 00:09:56.555
the air was pulsing.

00:09:56.579 --> 00:09:58.415
The whole place was absolutely silent,

00:09:58.439 --> 00:10:01.875
but the silence wasn't
an absence of noise.